REPAIRAGENT-OCI THOUGHTS: [0m The focused source read shows the regression point directly: ConfigValidator.Validate invokes v.mounts, and v.mounts rejects any mount whose Destination is not filepath.IsAbs. The reproduction payload uses destination "templated_config", so this code returns "mount destination not absolute" before container setup. Given the upstream issue describes this as a runc master regression from mount validation breaking Moby CI, the concrete repair direction is to relax or remove this hard validation so relative destinations remain accepted by the runtime compatibility path rather than failing during config validation.
